      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/hilltop_south_carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hilltop encompasses a total area of about one point eight square miles and consists entirely of land.",
